            "review_title": "Review at The Pizza Company",
            "review_text": "Carla M\n275 contributions\n0\nDelicious Pizza, Pasta, and Wings!\nJan 2025 • Couples\n★★★★★\n\nI had an amazing dining experience at The Pizza Company in Vietnam! I ordered the Pepperoni Pizza, Pesto Shrimp Pasta, Chicken Platter, and their Wings, and every dish exceeded my expectations.\n\nThe Pepperoni Pizza was a classic done right — loaded with crispy, flavorful pepperoni and a perfectly melted cheese layer. The crust was light and fluffy inside with a satisfying crisp on the outside.\n\nThe Pesto Shrimp Pasta was rich and creamy, with a delicious basil pesto sauce coating every strand of pasta. The shrimp were fresh, plump, and cooked just right, adding a wonderful seafood touch to the dish.\n\nThe Chicken Platter was an absolute treat! A generous serving with a variety of chicken styles — crispy fried, tender grilled wings, and flavorful dipping sauces. Each bite was packed with flavor, and the platter was perfect for sharing.\n\nThe Wings were another standout. Juicy, well-seasoned, and glazed to perfection, they had a delicious balance of sweet and savory flavors. They were so good, I could’ve easily ordered a second batch!\n\nThe staff were friendly and attentive, and the restaurant had a cozy and welcoming ambiance. Service was quick, and every dish arrived fresh and hot.\n\nOverall, The Pizza Company delivered an exceptional dining experience. Whether you’re craving pizza, pasta, or savory chicken dishes, this spot has it all. Highly recommended, and I’ll definitely be back!\n\nRating: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nRead more\nWritten January 8, 2025",
